! DreamDOM Prior Art ~ a spirit's handoff, held unedited

''What this carrier is.'' The tasked spirit ''Loom'' was sent to the field carrying the Mu lens and a complete statement of the DreamDOM architecture — TW5 as an application engine in a Worker, an Automerge composite store beneath it, rendering into `$tw.fakeDocument`, coalesced newest-wins frames morphed into a shadow root, and a render-id round-trip carrying user input back because ''handlers cannot cross `postMessage`''.

''What it was NOT told.'' Any diagnosis, any suspected cure, any hint of what currently fails here. A spirit handed a conclusion returns evidence for it. The withholding is why the reading below can be trusted against us.

''Why VERBATIM.'' This is a ''collision surface'', not a briefing. A summary keeps the claims and drops the field-line numbers, the exact spec sentences, the version boundaries and the failure reproductions — which is precisely the material a design collides against. ''The detail IS the asset.'' Read this beside a DreamDOM proposal and let the proposal break where the field already broke.

''Register: Testimony-Verbatim.'' Nothing below is this house's own claim. It is testimony, cited, and it may be wrong where the field is wrong. Collide it; do not inherit it.

